<title>USA: Investor cuts Cambex stake.</title>
<headline>Investor cuts Cambex stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>New York investor Selig Zises said on Tuesday he reduced his stake in Cambex Corp to 43,600 common shares or 0.5 percent of the total outstanding.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Zises said his latest transactions on Cambex include the sale of 59,000 shares between July 18 and August 30 at prices ranging from $3.97 to $4.92 a share.</p>
</text>
